      "text": "Running example: one attention head, d_h = 128  →  64 rotation pairs, i = 0 … 63 ·  base = 10000 (RoFormer, Llama-2)  ·  Llama-3 uses base = 500000  ·  q, k ∈ R^128 per head per token",
      "originalText": "Running example: one attention head, d_h = 128  →  64 rotation pairs, i = 0 … 63 ·  base = 10000 (RoFormer, Llama-2)  ·  Llama-3 uses base = 500000  ·  q, k ∈ R^128 per head per token",
