      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 · Why a position signal at all?",
      "originalText": "1 · Why a position signal at all?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 272,
      "width": 1028.1000000000001,
      "height": 47.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 785310973,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1408466145,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Attention by itself is permutation-equivariant (no notion of order): score(m, n) = q_mᵀ k_n / √d_h\ncontains no m or n. Shuffle the tokens → the same scores, just shuffled. Order must be injected.",
      "originalText": "Attention by itself is permutation-equivariant (no notion of order): score(m, n) = q_mᵀ k_n / √d_h\ncontains no m or n. Shuffle the tokens → the same scores, just shuffled. Order must be injected.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
