      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Absolute (GPT-2, BERT)\n\nx_m ← x_m + p_m      (added at the input)\n\nscore mixes content and position:\n(x_m+p_m)ᵀW_qᵀW_k(x_n+p_n)\n= 4 terms, only implicitly relative\npositions > trained table: undefined",
      "originalText": "Absolute (GPT-2, BERT)\n\nx_m ← x_m + p_m      (added at the input)\n\nscore mixes content and position:\n(x_m+p_m)ᵀW_qᵀW_k(x_n+p_n)\n= 4 terms, only implicitly relative\npositions > trained table: undefined",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e7",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a8"
    },
    {
