      "versionNonce": 781220001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rotary (RoFormer, Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek)\n\nq_m ← R_m q_m ,  k_n ← R_n k_n\n(multiply, on every layer, Q and K only)\n\nscore = q_mᵀ R_{n−m} k_n\n→ depends ONLY on the offset n − m\nno parameters, norm preserved",
      "originalText": "Rotary (RoFormer, Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek)\n\nq_m ← R_m q_m ,  k_n ← R_n k_n\n(multiply, on every layer, Q and K only)\n\nscore = q_mᵀ R_{n−m} k_n\n→ depends ONLY on the offset n − m\nno parameters, norm preserved",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e9",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aA"
    },
