      "updated": 1791132667502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key insight: RoPE encodes ABSOLUTE position into q and k (each rotated by its own index), but the\ndot product only sees the DIFFERENCE of the two rotations → relative position for free.",
      "originalText": "Key insight: RoPE encodes ABSOLUTE position into q and k (each rotated by its own index), but the\ndot product only sees the DIFFERENCE of the two rotations → relative position for free.",
