    {
      "id": "e70",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1542.25,
      "width": 892.2500000000001,
      "height": 63.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1426256014,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 920813999,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key insight: low i = high frequency = sensitive to small offsets (local syntax); high i = low\nfrequency = barely moves over thousands of tokens (long-range / 'semantic' channel). One vector\ncarries a whole bank of clocks running at geometrically spaced speeds.",
      "originalText": "Key insight: low i = high frequency = sensitive to small offsets (local syntax); high i = low\nfrequency = barely moves over thousands of tokens (long-range / 'semantic' channel). One vector\ncarries a whole bank of clocks running at geometrically spaced speeds.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e69",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b09"
    },
    {
      "id": "e71",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1604,
      "y": 892.5,
      "width": 358.20000000000005,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 130286598,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2143483073,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 · Complex-number form",
      "originalText": "4 · Complex-number form",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0A"
    },
    {
      "id": "e72",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 946.5,
      "width": 825.7,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1506442652,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 161772495,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same thing in complex numbers (how RoFormer writes it): pair i ↔ one complex number",
      "originalText": "Same thing in complex numbers (how RoFormer writes it): pair i ↔ one complex number",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "e73",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 979,
      "width": 878.8,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1389698625,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 669562017,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "z_i = x_2i + j·x_2i+1                     (64 complex numbers per 128-d vector)\nRoPE(z_i, m) = z_i · e^{j·m·θ_i}           (rotation = multiply by a unit phasor)\n\nq̃_i = q_i e^{j m θ_i},   k̃_i = k_i e^{j n θ_i}\n\nq̃ᵀk̃ (real dot product) = Re Σ_i  q̃_i · conj(k̃_i)\n                       = Re Σ_i  q_i conj(k_i) · e^{j (m − n) θ_i}\n                                              └── only m − n survives ──┘",
      "originalText": "z_i = x_2i + j·x_2i+1                     (64 complex numbers per 128-d vector)\nRoPE(z_i, m) = z_i · e^{j·m·θ_i}           (rotation = multiply by a unit phasor)\n\nq̃_i = q_i e^{j m θ_i},   k̃_i = k_i e^{j n θ_i}\n\nq̃ᵀk̃ (real dot product) = Re Σ_i  q̃_i · conj(k̃_i)\n                       = Re Σ_i  q_i conj(k_i) · e^{j (m − n) θ_i}\n                                              └── only m − n survives ──┘",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0C"
    },
    {
      "id": "e74",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 1173,
      "width": 716.8000000000001,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2132657286,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 799220207,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code equivalent (torch.polar / view_as_complex in Llama reference code):",
      "originalText": "Code equivalent (torch.polar / view_as_complex in Llama reference code):",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0D"
    },
    {
      "id": "e75",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 1205.5,
      "width": 695.1999999999999,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1765070035,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1762359425,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "xq_ = view_as_complex(xq.reshape(B, T, H, 64, 2))   # (B,T,H,64) complex\nfreqs_cis = polar(ones, outer(pos, θ))             # (T, 64) complex\nxq_out = view_as_real(xq_ * freqs_cis).flatten(3)  # (B,T,H,128)",
      "originalText": "xq_ = view_as_complex(xq.reshape(B, T, H, 64, 2))   # (B,T,H,64) complex\nfreqs_cis = polar(ones, outer(pos, θ))             # (T, 64) complex\nxq_out = view_as_real(xq_ * freqs_cis).flatten(3)  # (B,T,H,128)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0E"
    },
    {
      "id": "e76",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 1281.5,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 72.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
