      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5 · Proof: ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩  (relative position)",
      "originalText": "5 · Proof: ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩  (relative position)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0K"
    },
    {
      "id": "e83",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1773,
      "width": 1228,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 126603649,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1287074415,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1   q̃_m = R_m q ,   k̃_n = R_n k                          q, k ∈ R^128 ;  R_m, R_n ∈ R^(128×128)\nStep 2   q̃_mᵀ k̃_n = (R_m q)ᵀ (R_n k) = qᵀ R_mᵀ R_n k\nStep 3   R_mᵀ = R_m⁻¹ = R_{−m}                                 (rotation is orthogonal; per 2×2 block)\nStep 4   R_{−m} R_n = R_{n−m}                                  (angles add: −mθ_i + nθ_i = (n−m)θ_i)\nStep 5   q̃_mᵀ k̃_n = qᵀ R_{n−m} k        ⇒  ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩   □",
      "originalText": "Step 1   q̃_m = R_m q ,   k̃_n = R_n k                          q, k ∈ R^128 ;  R_m, R_n ∈ R^(128×128)\nStep 2   q̃_mᵀ k̃_n = (R_m q)ᵀ (R_n k) = qᵀ R_mᵀ R_n k\nStep 3   R_mᵀ = R_m⁻¹ = R_{−m}                                 (rotation is orthogonal; per 2×2 block)\nStep 4   R_{−m} R_n = R_{n−m}                                  (angles add: −mθ_i + nθ_i = (n−m)θ_i)\nStep 5   q̃_mᵀ k̃_n = qᵀ R_{n−m} k        ⇒  ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩   □",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0L"
    },
    {
      "id": "e84",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1916,
      "width": 651.9000000000001,
      "height": 23.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1649767777,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1667149825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Worked numbers (pair i = 0, θ₀ = 1 rad/token, q = k = (1, 0)):",
      "originalText": "Worked numbers (pair i = 0, θ₀ = 1 rad/token, q = k = (1, 0)):",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0M"
    },
    {
      "id": "e85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1949.75,
      "width": 1213.6,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 277756008,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 186977423,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "query at m = 2,  key at n = 5   →  angles 2 rad, 5 rad    →  score = cos(5 − 2) = cos 3 = −0.990\nquery at m = 10, key at n = 13  →  angles 10 rad, 13 rad  →  score = cos(13 − 10) = cos 3 = −0.990   (identical)",
      "originalText": "query at m = 2,  key at n = 5   →  angles 2 rad, 5 rad    →  score = cos(5 − 2) = cos 3 = −0.990\nquery at m = 10, key at n = 13  →  angles 10 rad, 13 rad  →  score = cos(13 − 10) = cos 3 = −0.990   (identical)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0N"
    },
    {
      "id": "e86",
      "type": "ellipse",
