      "updated": 1791132667504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key insight: the cached key never needs to know where the query will be. Any (m, n) with the same n − m gives the same score — exactly the translation-invariance language needs ('the word 3 tokens ago').",
