      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem: pairs whose λ_i exceeds the training length (right of the red line crossing)\nnever completed one full turn during training. Past L_train they produce angles the\nmodel has never seen → this is where length extrapolation breaks (section 9).",
      "originalText": "Problem: pairs whose λ_i exceeds the training length (right of the red line crossing)\nnever completed one full turn during training. Past L_train they produce angles the\nmodel has never seen → this is where length extrapolation breaks (section 9).",
