      "text": "# rope.py — build once, shapes for d_h = 128\ninv_freq = 1/(base**(arange(0, d, 2)/d))  # (64,)\nfreqs = outer(pos, inv_freq)              # (T_max, 64)\nemb   = cat([freqs, freqs], -1)           # (T_max, 128)\ncos, sin = emb.cos(), emb.sin()           # (T_max, 128) each\n\ndef rotate_half(x):                       # x: (B, H, T, 128)\n    x1, x2 = x.chunk(2, -1)               # (B, H, T, 64) each\n    return cat([-x2, x1], -1)             # (B, H, T, 128)\n\nc, s = cos[off:off+T], sin[off:off+T]     # (T, 128) → broadcast\nq = q*c + rotate_half(q)*s                # (B, H_q,  T, 128)\nk = k*c + rotate_half(k)*s                # (B, H_kv, T, 128)",
      "originalText": "# rope.py — build once, shapes for d_h = 128\ninv_freq = 1/(base**(arange(0, d, 2)/d))  # (64,)\nfreqs = outer(pos, inv_freq)              # (T_max, 64)\nemb   = cat([freqs, freqs], -1)           # (T_max, 128)\ncos, sin = emb.cos(), emb.sin()           # (T_max, 128) each\n\ndef rotate_half(x):                       # x: (B, H, T, 128)\n    x1, x2 = x.chunk(2, -1)               # (B, H, T, 64) each\n    return cat([-x2, x1], -1)             # (B, H, T, 128)\n\nc, s = cos[off:off+T], sin[off:off+T]     # (T, 128) → broadcast\nq = q*c + rotate_half(q)*s                # (B, H_q,  T, 128)\nk = k*c + rotate_half(k)*s                # (B, H_kv, T, 128)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
