      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "element j < 64:  q'_j      = q_j·cos(mθ_j) − q_{j+64}·sin(mθ_j)\nelement j+64  :  q'_{j+64} = q_{j+64}·cos(mθ_j) + q_j·sin(mθ_j)   ← the 2×2 rotation",
      "originalText": "element j < 64:  q'_j      = q_j·cos(mθ_j) − q_{j+64}·sin(mθ_j)\nelement j+64  :  q'_{j+64} = q_{j+64}·cos(mθ_j) + q_j·sin(mθ_j)   ← the 2×2 rotation",
      "fontSize": 17,
