      "versionNonce": 2062072257,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trade-off / gotcha: HF & this repo pair dims (j, j+64) ('half-split'); the paper and Meta's complex\ncode pair (2i, 2i+1) ('interleaved'). Same math up to a fixed permutation of W_q/W_k rows — but the\ncheckpoint and kernel MUST agree (HF conversion scripts permute W_q, W_k for this reason).",
      "originalText": "Trade-off / gotcha: HF & this repo pair dims (j, j+64) ('half-split'); the paper and Meta's complex\ncode pair (2i, 2i+1) ('interleaved'). Same math up to a fixed permutation of W_q/W_k rows — but the\ncheckpoint and kernel MUST agree (HF conversion scripts permute W_q, W_k for this reason).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e246",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b30"
    },
