    {
      "id": "e287",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 3525,
      "width": 772,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2023317399,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1812344641,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "K-cache (B, 8, t, 128): keys stored ALREADY rotated at their absolute position n",
      "originalText": "K-cache (B, 8, t, 128): keys stored ALREADY rotated at their absolute position n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "e288",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 3565,
      "width": 646.6,
      "height": 63.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 557470198,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1646797135,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "score(t, n) = (R_t q_t)ᵀ(R_n k_n)/√128 = q_tᵀ R_{n−t} k_n /√128\nwork per step: rotate 1 q (32×128) + 1 k (8×128) → O(H·d_h)\nold keys are never re-rotated: their n is fixed; only q moves",
      "originalText": "score(t, n) = (R_t q_t)ᵀ(R_n k_n)/√128 = q_tᵀ R_{n−t} k_n /√128\nwork per step: rotate 1 q (32×128) + 1 k (8×128) → O(H·d_h)\nold keys are never re-rotated: their n is fixed; only q moves",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "e289",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 3638.75,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1201546738,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1289789217,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e290"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b3g"
    },
    {
      "id": "e290",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 3653.75,
      "width": 873.5500000000001,
      "height": 63.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2025650538,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1716854639,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key insight: because relative position emerges from the dot product, RoPE is cache-friendly —\nrotate once at write time, append, done (notebook 07 checks: rotating at offset = past_len\nequals rotating the full sequence).",
      "originalText": "Key insight: because relative position emerges from the dot product, RoPE is cache-friendly —\nrotate once at write time, append, done (notebook 07 checks: rotating at offset = past_len\nequals rotating the full sequence).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e289",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3h"
    },
    {
      "id": "e291",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 3748.5,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1803885801,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 748819201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e292"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791132667508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b3i"
    },
    {
      "id": "e292",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 3763.5,
      "width": 845.5000000000001,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 294493963,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1954371983,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem: absolute positions are baked into the cached K. Anything that renumbers positions\n(sliding window / attention-sink re-indexing, changing θ for context extension, MLA weight\nabsorption) needs pre-RoPE K or a re-rotation R_Δ — and RoPE is why MLA needs a decoupled\npath (W^UQ_iᵀ R_{n−t} W^UK_i is position-dependent, see docs/MLA.excalidraw).",
      "originalText": "Problem: absolute positions are baked into the cached K. Anything that renumbers positions\n(sliding window / attention-sink re-indexing, changing θ for context extension, MLA weight\nabsorption) needs pre-RoPE K or a re-rotation R_Δ — and RoPE is why MLA needs a decoupled\npath (W^UQ_iᵀ R_{n−t} W^UK_i is position-dependent, see docs/MLA.excalidraw).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e291",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3j"
    },
