      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9 · Context extension: beyond the trained length",
      "originalText": "9 · Context extension: beyond the trained length",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3l"
    },
    {
      "id": "e296",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 4015.5,
      "width": 1696.9,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 516767805,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2129135297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure mode: train at L_train (e.g. 8192), run at L' = s·L_train. Fast pairs have seen every angle many times; slow pairs (λ_i > L_train) only saw an arc → unseen angles,\nattention logits out of distribution, perplexity explodes just past L_train. Fixes rescale θ_i (example: L_train = 8192, base 10000, d_h = 128, s = 4):",
      "originalText": "Failure mode: train at L_train (e.g. 8192), run at L' = s·L_train. Fast pairs have seen every angle many times; slow pairs (λ_i > L_train) only saw an arc → unseen angles,\nattention logits out of distribution, perplexity explodes just past L_train. Fixes rescale θ_i (example: L_train = 8192, base 10000, d_h = 128, s = 4):",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3m"
