    },
    {
      "id": "e393",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4570.5,
      "width": 929.6500000000001,
      "height": 63.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 735952588,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 14059471,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key insight: don't squash the fast pairs (they encode local order, already seen at every angle);\nonly stretch the slow pairs that never completed a turn. NTK does it smoothly via the base,\nYaRN does it explicitly per pair — Llama-3's base 500000 bakes a slower spectrum in from the start.",
      "originalText": "Key insight: don't squash the fast pairs (they encode local order, already seen at every angle);\nonly stretch the slow pairs that never completed a turn. NTK does it smoothly via the base,\nYaRN does it explicitly per pair — Llama-3's base 500000 bakes a slower spectrum in from the start.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e392",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b5L"
    },
    {
      "id": "e394",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 4555.5,
      "width": 1480,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1787321731,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 59891873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e395"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791132667509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5M"
    },
    {
      "id": "e395",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 4570.5,
      "width": 873.5500000000001,
      "height": 63.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517681244,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 527611375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trade-off: every rescaling changes θ_i, so (a) the model usually needs a short long-context\nfine-tune, and (b) a KV cache written under one θ is invalid under another (dynamic schemes).\nLonger context also means a linearly bigger KV cache: 2·L·B·T·H_kv·d_h·S.",
      "originalText": "Trade-off: every rescaling changes θ_i, so (a) the model usually needs a short long-context\nfine-tune, and (b) a KV cache written under one θ is invalid under another (dynamic schemes).\nLonger context also means a linearly bigger KV cache: 2·L·B·T·H_kv·d_h·S.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e394",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b5N"
    },
