      "locked": false,
      "text": "10 · Cheat-sheet",
      "originalText": "10 · Cheat-sheet",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b5P"
    },
    {
      "id": "e398",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 4801.25,
      "width": 984.4,
      "height": 118.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 746362614,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1899555937,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791132667509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "θ_i = base^(−2i/d_h)            λ_i = 2π/θ_i : 6.3 … 54,410 tokens (d_h=128, base 1e4)\nq̃_m = R_m q,  k̃_n = R_n k       ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩\ncode: x*cos + rotate_half(x)*sin  on Q (B,H_q,T,128) and K (B,H_kv,T,128), not V\ncache: store rotated K at absolute n; rotate only the new q, k at step t\nextend: PI m/s · NTK base·s^(d/(d−2)) · YaRN per-pair ramp + 0.1·ln s + 1 temperature",
      "originalText": "θ_i = base^(−2i/d_h)            λ_i = 2π/θ_i : 6.3 … 54,410 tokens (d_h=128, base 1e4)\nq̃_m = R_m q,  k̃_n = R_n k       ⟨R_m q, R_n k⟩ = ⟨q, R_{n−m} k⟩\ncode: x*cos + rotate_half(x)*sin  on Q (B,H_q,T,128) and K (B,H_kv,T,128), not V\ncache: store rotated K at absolute n; rotate only the new q, k at step t\nextend: PI m/s · NTK base·s^(d/(d−2)) · YaRN per-pair ramp + 0.1·ln s + 1 temperature",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b5Q"
    },
