      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sources:\nRoFormer arXiv 2104.09864\nYaRN arXiv 2309.00071\nDeepSeek-V2 arXiv 2405.04434 (decoupled RoPE)\nMHA→MLA arXiv 2502.14837 (partial RoPE)",
      "originalText": "Sources:\nRoFormer arXiv 2104.09864\nYaRN arXiv 2309.00071\nDeepSeek-V2 arXiv 2405.04434 (decoupled RoPE)\nMHA→MLA arXiv 2502.14837 (partial RoPE)",
